# Fonts Directory

Place custom font files here (WOFF, WOFF2, TTF, OTF)

## Supported Formats

- WOFF (.woff)
- WOFF2 (.woff2) - Recommended
- TTF (.ttf)
- OTF (.otf)

## Usage Example

```css
/* In your CSS file */
@font-face {
  font-family: "CustomFont";
  src: url("./custom-font.woff2") format("woff2");
  font-weight: 400;
  font-style: normal;
}

body {
  font-family: "CustomFont", sans-serif;
}
```

## Import in JavaScript

```jsx
import "./fonts.css";
// or
import myFont from "./myfont.woff2";
```
